      "data": {
        "markdown": "# PASS\n\nDropping fixture 10's export Bridge onto this graph authors a `smoke-signal` workspace edge. Neither child graph becomes dirty, and the import Bridge is derived from the edge.\n\n# REJECT check\n\nAn export carrying another edge class must be rejected because this input accepts only `smoke-signal`."
